('P1','U-08','Contract/owner decisions that block exact conformance','(a) The complainant response has no field for the final decision, though decision 35 says the complainant sees it. (b) The delegation request has no holder field, so HR cannot delegate on behalf of someone (decision 10). (c) The executive director can send circulars but has no sent list or receipts operation. (d) A returned payroll run keeps its reason but the accountant has no field, notification or operation to read it. (e) The evaluation decision operation has no score field, so HR cannot adjust a grade with a reason. (f) The 5-working-day windows for evaluation and warning objections have no error code, so they are not enforced. (g) Contract renewal: the decision names the executive director, but the contract gives both steps to the HR manager. (h) Open owner questions: biometric device model, hosting country and currency, executive attendance coverage, approval of message wording and decisions 41, 54, 58, 59, 60 as defaults.','Behaviour was implemented to the contract; the requirements disagree with or are silent on these points.','Owner/backend decision, then contract update.'),
